<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-purgo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum, 1, <i>v. a., to clean out, cleanse</i> (rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato R.
					R. 50, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 112, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terram ab herba,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 151</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caules lactucae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 9, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sordes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					9, 14, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pisces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Stich. 2, 2, 35</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Esp. as med. t. t., <i>to cleanse, clear, purge</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eas partes ex quibus sputa feruntur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 2, 18, 110</span></i>
			; so <i>absol.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquae genus, quod potionibus depurgat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					8, 3, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
